{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 11,
  "name": {
    "ja": "カオスの特異点",
    "en": "Node of Chaos",
  },
  "definition": {
    "type": "KILL_ALL",
    "level": 65,
    "flags": ["PRESET", "ONCE"],
  },
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "カオス魔法の賢者たちが、近くの火山にカオスエネルギーの特異点の存在を確認",
          "した。我々カオス魔法の塔がその魔力の所有権を得られるように、おまえは",
          "その特異点の場所を見つけてそこに巣食うモンスターを片づけてくるのだ。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "The Wizards of Chaos have discovered a magical Node of",
          "Chaos in a nearby volcano. You must seek the Node and",
          "dispatch its guardians so that the Tower of Chaos can",
          "claim the mystical energies of the Node.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "REWARDED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["よくやった。強力な魔法書を外に置いておいた。"],
        "en": ["You have done well. A powerful spellbook awaits you outside."],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "FAILED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "立ち去れ、無能な馬鹿者め！魔法の特異点の次元エネルギーは",
          "消え去って永遠に失われたのだぞ！お前はせっかくのチャンスを",
          "棒にふったのだ。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "Begone, incompetent fool! The dimensional energies of the ",
          "mystic Node have faded away and are lost forever! You had",
          "your chance and botched the job. ",
        ],
      },
    },
  ],
